{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/compare/master...7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0","html_url":"https://github.com/asterisk/asterisk/compare/master...7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0","permalink_url":"https://github.com/asterisk/asterisk/compare/asterisk:7dc7542...asterisk:7a1ffcd","diff_url":"https://github.com/asterisk/asterisk/compare/master...7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/asterisk/asterisk/compare/master...7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"7dc7542a950cc64f2838bc0afd372d9263584e99","node_id":"C_kwDOAgOC1doAKDdkYzc1NDJhOTUwY2M2NGYyODM4YmMwYWZkMzcyZDkyNjM1ODRlOTk","commit":{"author":{"name":"juanjo","email":"juanjo@aroztegi.com","date":"2026-11-03T18:22:53Z"},"committer":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-05T14:03:52Z"},"message":"res_rtp_asterisk: Don't let symmetric RTP resume media on a held stream\n\nWhen the remote party puts a call on hold, res_pjsip_sdp_rtp answers\nrecvonly or inactive and stops the RTP instance, which clears the remote\naddress so that nothing more is sent. With rtp_symmetric enabled, the\nnext RTP packet from the held party set the remote address again in\nast_rtp_read(), and Asterisk resumed sending media for the rest of the\nhold. A sendonly holder keeps sending, so this happened on every such\nhold; on an inactive or c=0.0.0.0 hold, one late packet was enough.\n\nSymmetric RTP now only changes where RTP is sent if the remote side has\nexplicitly requested that media be sent to it. A stopped instance has no\nsuch request until new SDP makes one, as an unhold does, so the held\nparty's RTP no longer restarts it. A unit test covers the stopped case.\n\nAided by Claude Opus 5.5 (investigation, code).","tree":{"sha":"bd00e2ad4829dd6ddc3826910ab1ba879001b799","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/git/trees/bd00e2ad4829dd6ddc3826910ab1ba879001b799"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/git/commits/7dc7542a950cc64f2838bc0afd372d9263584e99","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/commits/7dc7542a950cc64f2838bc0afd372d9263584e99","html_url":"https://github.com/asterisk/asterisk/commit/7dc7542a950cc64f2838bc0afd372d9263584e99","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/commits/7dc7542a950cc64f2838bc0afd372d9263584e99/comments","author":{"login":"jjaroztegi","id":177890153,"node_id":"U_kgDOCppjaQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177890153?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjaroztegi","html_url":"https://github.com/jjaroztegi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjaroztegi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjaroztegi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjaroztegi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjaroztegi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjaroztegi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjaroztegi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjaroztegi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjaroztegi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjaroztegi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"01bb80606dcdb5fb116505382a87e7d5400e9276","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/commits/01bb80606dcdb5fb116505382a87e7d5400e9276","html_url":"https://github.com/asterisk/asterisk/commit/01bb80606dcdb5fb116505382a87e7d5400e9276"}]},"merge_base_commit":{"sha":"7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0","node_id":"C_kwDOAgOC1doAKDdhMWZmY2RmMzhjYzc2ZDFjNGVhZTUxNjUxNjY3ZjNmZDQ1NDhhYjA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Milan Kyselica","email":"mil.kyselica@gmail.com","date":"2026-03-24T18:22:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"George Joseph","email":"gtjoseph@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-25T14:21:09Z"},"message":"res_pjsip_pubsub: Add width limit to sscanf in MWI NOTIFY parser\n\nThe parse_simple_message_summary() function uses sscanf with an\nunbounded %s format specifier to parse the Message-Account field\nfrom incoming SIP NOTIFY bodies into a fixed-size 512-byte stack\nbuffer (PJSIP_MAX_URL_SIZE). A single unauthenticated SIP NOTIFY\nwith a Message-Account value exceeding 512 bytes overflows the\nbuffer, corrupting adjacent stack data and permanently disabling\nthe PJSIP transport layer without crashing the process.\n\nAdd a width specifier (%511s) to limit the sscanf write to\nPJSIP_MAX_URL_SIZE - 1 bytes plus the NUL terminator, matching\nthe destination buffer size.\n\nResolves: #GHSA-589g-qgf8-m6mx","tree":{"sha":"fa5b2de8a9805b8cda3dde0cb811fcba2ac37584","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/git/trees/fa5b2de8a9805b8cda3dde0cb811fcba2ac37584"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/git/commits/7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/commits/7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0","html_url":"https://github.com/asterisk/asterisk/commit/7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/commits/7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0/comments","author":{"login":"mil1200","id":18125445,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTI1NDQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18125445?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mil1200","html_url":"https://github.com/mil1200","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mil1200/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mil1200/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mil1200/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mil1200/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mil1200/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mil1200/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mil1200/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mil1200/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mil1200/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"gtjoseph","id":1205666,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDU2NjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1205666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtjoseph","html_url":"https://github.com/gtjoseph","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtjoseph/followers","following_url":"https://api